sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Op as Operator
  participant Front as APTP-front
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant Orch as Orchestrator
  participant Agents as Agents
  participant Redis as Redis
  participant AUT as Target app
  participant Disk as Artifacts disk

  Op->>Front: Create project / Process Drive folder
  Front->>API: POST /drive/projects/id/process
  API->>Orch: run payload mode=full
  Orch->>Redis: scope run:run_id

  loop Phase 1
    Orch->>Agents: intake → readiness → requirements → …
    Agents->>Redis: write artifacts
    Agents-->>Orch: stage updates
    Orch-->>Front: SSE pipeline events
  end

  opt missing target_url
    Orch-->>Front: awaiting_target_url
    Op->>Front: Enter AUT URL
    Front->>API: POST runtime-hints
    API->>Orch: resume intake_interpretation
  end

  loop Automation max attempts
    Orch->>Agents: playwright_architect → generator
    Agents->>Disk: generated-test-projects/
    Orch->>Agents: execution npx playwright
    Agents->>AUT: browser tests
    AUT-->>Agents: HTTP responses
    Agents->>Disk: evidence/ reports/
    alt failures
      Orch->>Agents: failure_rca → self_healing
      Agents->>Disk: patch pages/
    end
  end

  Orch->>Agents: defect_detection excel_deliverable
  Orch->>Disk: aptp-artifacts/run_id/
  Orch-->>Front: completed + reports
  Op->>Front: Download artifacts / view evidence PDF
